# Container scripts must keep LF endings on every platform: a CRLF shebang
# ("#!/bin/sh\r") makes Linux report "no such file or directory" and the
# container crash-loops. (Found when the Phase 6 branch was checked out on Windows.)
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
